      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow1:002",
        "answer": "Constructs background/text and schedules pending state evaluation. The text setText hook scales the parent to its label with margin4. Hidden is the recovered short-circuit union of demo/EMP/hardcore/guided missile/killcam/remote/hashes/vehicle/flash/scope/POTM/scoreboard/UI flags, absent HUD visibility or absent weapon-HUD visibility. Each subscribed visibility model only requests model_validation, not direct state selection. Registers close, optional postload, then SetupWaypointCloseShowMessageListener(self,text,controller), returns self. No waypoint event producer or lifetime guarantee is implied.",
